{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "The quatrefoil",
  "description": "The quatrefoil: the two first circles and the two lines through them for scaffolding, a small circle on the halfway point, four circles of that size centred on 0, on 1 and on the small circle's top and bottom, and a circle round all four, just touching them. The four leaves blue, the overlaps between neighbouring leaves red, the rest of the big circle green.",
  "steps": [
    "A circle centered on 0, through 1.",
    "A circle centered on 1, through 0.",
    "A line through 0 and 1.",
    "A line through the two crossings. It cuts the line from 0 to 1 exactly in half.",
    "A small circle centered on that halfway point, through 0. It crosses the upright line above and below.",
    "A circle centered on 0, through the halfway point.",
    "The same, centered on 1.",
    "The same, centered on the top of the small circle.",
    "And centered on its bottom. Four leaves.",
    "A circle centered on the halfway point, through the far left of the left leaf. It just touches all four leaves."
  ],
